<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for Budget Home Fixes.">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: September 14, 2026</em></p>

  <p>
    Budget Home Fixes ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This policy explains what data is
    collected when you visit thebudgethomefixes.com and how it's used.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    We use standard analytics tools that may collect anonymized data such as pages visited,
    approximate location (country/city level), device type, and referral source. We do not
    require account creation or collect personal information unless you voluntarily email us.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
  <p>
    This site uses or plans to use Google AdSense to display advertising. Google and its
    partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this site or other
    sites on the internet. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
    <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>,
    or opt out of third-party vendor cookies generally at
    <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices" target="_blank" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party links</h2>
  <p>
    Some articles link to third-party retailers or products. We are not responsible for the
    privacy practices of those external sites.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@thebudgethomefixes.com">hello@thebudgethomefixes.com</a>.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
